UID:princeton-crockett-lab-postdoc-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261020T144136Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Deadline: Postdoctoral Fellow 2027\, Crockett Lab (Princeton Psycho
 logy and University Center for Human Values)
DESCRIPTION:Molly Crockett's lab at Princeton\, based in the Department of 
 Psychology and the University Center for Human Values\, is hiring a postdo
 c to start in summer or fall 2027. The research topic is flexible. The lab
  uses methods from computational social science and cognitive science info
 rmed by theory from science and technology studies and feminist epistemolo
 gy\, studying feedback loops between individual psychology\, institutions 
 and culture\, and how the tech industry co-opts these processes to concent
 rate power. It is especially interested in bridging quantitative and quali
 tative methods for understanding human experience\, and in how culture and
  power shape which questions are valued and which methods are legitimised.
  The lab is industry-independent and accepts no research funding from the 
 tech industry\; it uses a variety of ML methods and aims to develop though
 tful approaches to automation in scholarship\, so it suits researchers exc
 ited about AI in science but wary of hype and industry influence. WHAT YOU
  GET: an USD 80\,000 salary from stable institutional funds\, initial one-
 year appointment renewable up to three years. APPLICATION: via Interfolio\
 ; questions about fit to mj.crockett@princeton.edu. Review of applications
  begins 20 November 2026 and continues until the position is filled.\n\nOr
 ganisation: Princeton University\, Crockett Lab (Department of Psychology 
 and University Center for Human Values)\nLocation: Princeton\, New Jersey\
 , USA.\nAward: USD 80\,000 annual salary from a stable institutional fundi
 ng source (not a cancellable grant).\nDuration: Initial one-year appointme
 nt\, renewable up to three years\, starting summer or fall 2027.\n\nMore: 
 https://apply.interfolio.com/195297?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
 utm_medium=referral
URL:https://apply.interfolio.com/195297?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantde
 sk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Princeton\, New Jersey\, USA.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
